Synthesis, identification and application of the novel metal-organic framework \(\mathsf{Fe}_{3}\mathsf{O}_{4}@\mathsf{PAA@ZIF-8}\) for the drug delivery of ciprofloxacin and investigation of antibacterial activity
Maryam Esfahanian, Mohammad Ali Ghasemzadeh & Seyyed Mohammad Hossein Razavian
